    "description": "<p>The caster tests Will against the target's Will.</p><p><strong>On success:</strong> the caster seizes the target exactly as the winner of a Mind Bending duel does, taking control of its body and gaining full access to its memories and knowledge. The target may repeat the test once per week to break free.</p><p>If the host has no access to magic or to the Blood School, the caster cannot use them either. The possession can be ended by exorcism.</p><p>If the caster is expelled, the host vomits the caster out and loses consciousness, and the caster is Stunned for two turns.</p>",
